---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About // inference lab"
  description="Srikanth Malipatel is a software engineer interested in distributed systems, machine learning, and inference engineering."
>
  <span class="label-sys-bright">About me</span>
  <h1
    style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-weight:700;font-size:1.875rem;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0.375rem 0 1.5rem;color:hsl(var(--steel))"
  >
    Srikanth Malipatel
  </h1>
  <div class="markdown" style="max-width:65ch">
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer working on distributed systems and machine
      learning. I enjoy building reliable systems, understanding how they
      behave under load, and making them easier to operate.
    </p>
    <p>
      Lately, I've been spending more time on inference engineering: how
      language models run on GPUs, what limits their performance, and how
      choices around memory, batching, and serving affect latency and throughput.
      This blog is where I share experiments and what I learn along the way.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can reach me at
      <a href="mailto:srikanthmalipatel0007@gmail.com">srikanthmalipatel0007@gmail.com</a>
      or find me on
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/srikk595/" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>
      and
      <a href="https://github.com/srikanthmalipatel" rel="me">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="about-note">
      This is a personal blog. Views are my own.
      Product and company names belong to their respective owners.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
